 2575: //    Assumption: the 4 points (including those of the side segment) are different.
 2576: //    The eqs. for the 2 lines are: X=X1+(X2-X1)*tt1 and X=X3+(X4-X3)*tt2.	
 2577: //    Output: false: no intersection or colinear; true: exactly 1 intersection.	
 2578: //    If true, (xIntersect,yIntersect) is the intersection.				
 2579: //    Modified to only check tt2, assuming 0<=tt1<=1 is already assured. 
 2580: // **/
